-- Add spell_area rows present in the upstream LegionCore 2024-10-23 world dump
-- (The-Legion-Preservation-Project/LegionCore-7.3.5) but missing from our world DB.
-- Source lacks teamId (not team-restricted; this core's only Legion/TW-specific
-- column) and flags (closest analogue classmask/active_event/autocast serve
-- different, unrelated purposes not read by SpellMgr::LoadSpellAreas, so they were
-- dropped). Defaulted teamId=-1 and flags=3, matching this table's own column
-- defaults and ~75% of our existing rows. Matched on the columns both schemas
-- share (spell, area, quest_start, aura_spell, racemask, gender); deduplicated by
-- the same key since source PK also includes classmask/active_event.
